Bilkul. Agar aap **complete Clinic Management System (CMS)** banana chahte ho jisme clinic ke almost har kaam ka software solution ho, to main ise **starting se end tak complete clinic workflow** ke hisaab se structure karunga.

Hospital ke comparison mein clinic mein ICU, OT, blood bank jaise modules generally nahi hote, lekin **OPD, appointment, EMR, prescription, billing, pharmacy, lab, inventory, accounts, staff, CRM, communication, reports aur admin** ko properly cover karna chahiye.

