### Is system ka ideal core flow:

**Registration → Appointment → Check-in → Queue → Consultation → EMR → Diagnosis → Investigation → Report → Prescription → Procedure / Pharmacy → Billing → Payment → Receipt → Follow-up → Reminder → Next Visit → Complete Patient History**

Aur sabse important architectural point: **Patient, Visit/Encounter, Appointment, EMR, Prescription, Order, Bill, Payment aur Inventory ko central entities rakho**. Inke around baaki saare modules connect honge. Isse baad mein clinic ko **multi-doctor, multi-branch aur enterprise level** tak le jaana easy rahega.


Agar aap **Complete Clinic Management System** bana rahe ho, to sabse important cheez hai ki har role ka dashboard alag ho. Doctor ko clinical information chahiye, receptionist ko appointments aur patients, cashier ko payments, aur admin ko poore clinic ka business overview.

**Ek hi dashboard sabko mat dena.** Har user ko login ke baad uske role ke according dashboard, sections, buttons, reports aur permissions milni chahiye.

