# 23. DASHBOARD PERMISSIONS — SABSE IMPORTANT

Role ke naam se hi access decide mat karo. **Role + individual permissions + branch scope** ke basis par access control rakho.

Example:

| Action | Doctor | Receptionist | Cashier | Admin |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Patient Registration | View / permitted edit | Create / Edit | Limited view | Full authorized access |
| Clinical Notes | Create / Edit own permitted records | No | No | As authorized |
| Prescription | Create / Sign as authorized | No | No | As authorized |
| Appointment | View / Manage own schedule | Create / Manage | View as needed | Manage |
| Payment Collection | View if permitted | Limited collection | Collect | View / Manage |
| Refund Approval | No by default | No by default | Request / process approved refund | According to authority |
| User Management | No | No | No | Authorized admin |
| Financial Reports | Own permitted information | Limited | Collection reports | Authorized full access |
| Audit Logs | Limited, if needed | No | Limited | Authorized access |

Aap permissions ko aur detail mein divide kar sakte ho:

- View
- Create
- Edit
- Delete
- Approve
- Print
- Export
- Sign
- Refund
- Reverse
- Assign
- Branch Access

Clinical aur financial records mein sensitive actions ke liye audit trail hona chahiye.

