# 24. MERI RECOMMENDATION: DASHBOARD BANANE KA BEST TARIKA

Har role ke liye alag software mat banao. Ek hi application rakho, lekin login user ke role aur permissions ke basis par dashboard render karo.

Example:

```text
LOGIN
  |
  v
IDENTIFY USER
  |
  v
LOAD ROLES + PERMISSIONS + BRANCH SCOPE
  |
  v
OPEN ROLE-BASED DASHBOARD
  |
  +---- Clinic Admin Dashboard
  |
  +---- Doctor Dashboard
  |
  +---- Reception Dashboard
  |
  +---- Nurse Dashboard
  |
  +---- Lab Dashboard
  |
  +---- Pharmacy Dashboard
  |
  +---- Cashier Dashboard
  |
  +---- Accountant Dashboard
  |
  +---- Inventory Dashboard
  |
  +---- HR Dashboard
  |
  +---- Patient Portal
```

### Har dashboard mein 4 fixed parts rakho

**1. Overview:** User ko uske kaam se related important numbers dikhayein.

**2. Work Queue:** Abhi kaunse patients, appointments, prescriptions, payments ya tasks pending hain.

**3. Quick Actions:** User apna common kaam minimum clicks mein kar sake.

**4. Alerts:** Sirf relevant aur actionable notifications dikhayein.

**Final suggestion:** Ek standard clinic ke liye sabse pehle **Clinic Admin, Doctor, Receptionist, Nurse/Assistant aur Cashier** dashboards banao. Agar clinic mein in-house lab, pharmacy ya home collection hai, to unke dashboards add karo. Accountant, inventory, HR, CRM aur quality dashboards ko un services aur clinic ke size ke according enable karo. Isse software comprehensive rahega, lekin dashboard unnecessary features se overloaded nahi hoga.